"1920-E.png", "id": "1068495515503280", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_1068495518836613_6378278017046238503_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O4VrFIsoi8wQ7kNvwFBx1Rr&_nc_oc=AdrXuqreiY4SXJqOHjLjfDJVI5DSzAw1xvcazIo9aSEZoq_GDnmKJJGjYQ-6G2cfqko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCbH2dpuUiuNL6NvUHca6I74FslIXfL0LLXdvSgoka4BA&oe=6A622F3B"}, {"file_name": "1920-G (1).png", "id": "27665562543083832", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_27665562576417162_8539978051617739066_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AZqunInP3-AQ7kNvwHkemW3&_nc_oc=AdqsunSboOHwvbipGMk6NEg1tGCPgROhPQPvnxZLeGnCQStflxV-BpxDJ-4r4OR0zJI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDO9L1QnC7dFpP_zIBeEmHZ_2Kk_9LVGkuhwPGU-3aaIA&oe=6A622B46"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverART2560-1440.png", "id": "1614965387297641", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623443_1614965390630974_4511375871821283395_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NNw5XGqOuMAQ7kNvwEGFmE7&_nc_oc=AdpeW-TpCkfRgeS8qghkEw9pC-PaZ4dppKGumNMZx58MUNZIYl884ENcEe0C-TJYbu0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCWbbkq35zvF5mty448bL1YqKPc_qJwfqAmQDBqCoXVng&oe=6A6234CB"}, "display_name": "Stunt X Mania (SXM)", "keywords": ["Stunt", "Race", "Sports", "MotoX", "Racing"], "long_description": "# Push the limits, defy gravity, and perform insane stunts!\n\n\ud83c\udfae **Game Overview**: \nStunt X Mania isn't just a game, it's an experience. Have you ever wondered if you could go crazy and perform insane motocross and stunts at home? We bring to you hyper-realistic bike controls like you've never experienced before! Hone your riding skills and go on a frenzy of stunts, wheelies, endos, 360 flips, and more. Our early access will help you get ready for our exciting next updates\n\n\ud83c\udfc1 **Key Features**\n- Perform 360 flips, Superman, Cliffhanger, Lazy-boy, and Heel-clicker and 8 more stunts!\n- Enjoy a new hyper-realistic vehicle control system, with engaging clutch and gear mechanics, wheelies, endos, whips, and crazy jumps!\n\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f **Game Modes**\n\n- **Free Roam** -  No-holds barred, perform tricks without thinking of running out of time across 5 CRAZY ARENAS!\n\n- **Career Mode** - Perform stunts to earn points and finish the lap before time ends and ride to glory .\n\n- **Challenges Mode** - Perform stunts to earn points and  other objectives .\n\n- **Co-op** - Ride with friends and family, display your skills and become a pro! (COMING SOON)\n\n- **Multiplayer** - Be the Master, champion lobbies, and boast your skills! (COMING SOON)\n\n\ud83c\udfa7 **Immersive Soundtrack**\n\n- **High-energy electronic beats** to enhance your ride. Featuring tracks from our own indie-crew.\n\nThis is not the end! We will bring enhancing updates across the game, more stunts, new arenas, a brand new store, DLCs and more. **Stunt X Mania is the place to be, you can't miss it!**", "short_description": "Stunt X Mania (SXM) is an adrenaline-pumping motocross and stunts game where players perform freestyle tricks, defy physics, and hone their motocross skills across electrifying open arenas. With hyper realistic bike control and high-speed circuits, and crazy stunts, Stunt X Mania is for thrill-seekers. Enjoy 20 arenas, hyper-realistic bike controls, wheelies, endos, 360 flips. You want more? Execute Superman, Lazy Boy, Cliffhangers, Heel Click stunts right now! Career Mode and Challenges Mode!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://revrgames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ReVR Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://revrgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "cont